WEBVTT

00:09.257 --> 00:11.927
<b>It's morning, Big Brother. Time to get up.</b>

00:14.557 --> 00:18.977
<b>You go on without me.
I'm tired from battle and I want to sleep.</b>

00:20.027 --> 00:23.107
<b>No can do.
I have to comb and tie your hair back.</b>

00:24.447 --> 00:28.077
<b>And if you don't get up,
Father will just keep nuzzling you.</b>

00:28.157 --> 00:29.237
<b>I'll get up.</b>

00:32.787 --> 00:36.787
<b>How pretty. Even after an intense battle,
it's not damaged.</b>

00:37.627 --> 00:40.247
<b>You received the name "Tokiyuki"
during your genpuku ceremony,</b>

00:40.337 --> 00:43.297
<b>but you never cut your hair
as part of becoming an adult, did you?</b>

00:44.167 --> 00:47.587
<b>Because all the important retainers
told me not to cut it just yet.</b>

00:48.097 --> 00:50.757
<b>My brother never listened
and went and cut his own hair anyway.</b>

00:50.847 --> 00:52.307
<b><i>It's so annoying to maintain.</i></b>

00:52.387 --> 00:53.847
<b>Was he not supposed to?</b>

00:54.347 --> 00:56.897
<b>Long hair is a symbol
of good luck, Shizuku.</b>

00:57.557 --> 00:58.687
<b>Good luck?</b>

00:59.817 --> 01:04.187
<b>Hair that has never been cut
represents purity.</b>

01:04.737 --> 01:07.817
<b>Children are said to possess holy powers,</b>

01:07.907 --> 01:10.367
<b>and a child whose hair has never been cut</b>

01:10.447 --> 01:12.617
<b>is the absolute embodiment
of all that is auspicious.</b>

01:13.617 --> 01:17.537
<b>Which is why I have left your hair uncut.</b>

01:18.287 --> 01:19.457
<b>Warriors are particularly drawn
to anything</b>

01:19.537 --> 01:21.127
<b>that brings them good luck
on the battlefield.</b>

01:21.207 --> 01:24.547
<b>A child with such long, luxurious hair
leading an army</b>

01:24.627 --> 01:26.797
<b>is sure to strengthen warriors' hearts.</b>

01:28.047 --> 01:31.307
<b>But if you are to
become the lord of the realm,</b>

01:31.387 --> 01:33.767
<b>you cannot remain
with a child's long hair forever.</b>

01:35.137 --> 01:36.137
<b>Lord Tokiyuki.</b>

01:37.687 --> 01:39.687
<b>If you do manage to reclaim the throne…</b>

01:41.687 --> 01:42.687
<b>Um…</b>

01:43.687 --> 01:47.697
<b>Would it be all right if I cut your hair?</b>

01:53.077 --> 01:54.077
<b>Of course.</b>

02:05.917 --> 02:10.007
<b><i>If he cuts my hair, that would make him</i>
<i>my eboshi-oya. My genpuku sponsor.</i></b>

02:11.177 --> 02:13.677
<b><i>I don't really mind either way.</i></b>

02:15.387 --> 02:17.887
<b><i>At times, it feels like</i>
<i>he has me in the palm of his hand.</i></b>

02:18.687 --> 02:21.057
<b><i>He can be selfish,</i>
<i>and somewhat of a dictator.</i></b>

02:22.357 --> 02:24.897
<b><i>He's annoying</i>
<i>when he tells me to "Study, study, study."</i></b>

02:25.897 --> 02:27.857
<b><i>He does hold me in his arms sometimes.</i></b>

02:29.277 --> 02:31.777
<b><i>And at times, he'd drop everything</i>
<i>and come to rescue me.</i></b>

02:45.997 --> 02:47.297
<b><i>I see.</i></b>

02:50.337 --> 02:52.387
<b><i>At some point, I…</i></b>

02:56.807 --> 02:57.977
<b>Ouch!</b>

02:58.057 --> 03:00.437
<b>Hey, you. Don't let
all this special treatment</b>

03:00.517 --> 03:03.147
<b>go to your head
just because you're a Hojo kid.</b>

03:04.187 --> 03:08.237
<b>They made me a god.
That means I'm better than you.</b>

03:09.897 --> 03:11.197
<b>Oh, my. Lord Tokiyuki.</b>

03:12.527 --> 03:16.117
<b>My apologies
for not being able to visit more often.</b>

03:16.197 --> 03:17.537
<b>SON OF YORISHIGE SUWA
TOKITSUGU SUWA</b>

03:17.617 --> 03:19.327
<b>Mr. Tokitsugu. It's been a while.</b>

03:20.707 --> 03:24.707
<b>I take it this is your first time
meeting my son? This is Yoritsugu.</b>

03:26.667 --> 03:29.457
<b>What's the matter, Yoritsugu?
Have you introduced yourself yet?</b>

03:32.007 --> 03:33.797
<b>Yes, Father dear.</b>

03:34.547 --> 03:38.637
<b>I was so nervous because I finally got to
meet Lord Tokiyuki, whom I admire so much.</b>

03:38.717 --> 03:40.387
<b>I just blurted out a greeting,
and I think I startled him a little.</b>

03:40.477 --> 03:42.557
<b>I must have startled him a little.</b>

03:42.637 --> 03:43.727
<b>Where are your manners?</b>

03:43.807 --> 03:45.807
<b>Please forgive him, Lord Tokiyuki.</b>

03:46.357 --> 03:49.067
<b>Come! Let's go see Grandpapa together!</b>

03:50.647 --> 03:54.197
<b><i>I was shocked when I heard that</i>
<i>Mr. Yorishige had a grandson, but…</i></b>

03:55.567 --> 03:59.997
<b><i>What does he mean they "made him a god"?</i>
<i>Actually, before that…</i></b>

04:03.867 --> 04:05.417
<b>GRANDSON OF YORISHIGE SUWA
YORITSUGU SUWA</b>

04:05.497 --> 04:07.587
<b>Let's get this straight once and for all.</b>

04:07.667 --> 04:10.917
<b>A god versus the Hojo… Who outranks who?</b>

04:11.007 --> 04:17.047
<b><i>He's a grouch! He's a cantankerous,</i>
<i>crusty, little grouch!</i></b>

04:35.657 --> 04:40.447
<b>THE ELUSIVE SAMURAI</b>

05:48.017 --> 05:49.017
<b>TWO YEARS AGO</b>

05:49.097 --> 05:50.767
<b>You're so cute, Yoritsugu!</b>

05:50.857 --> 05:54.187
<b>One day you will inherit all of Suwa
and become a marvelous god!</b>

05:54.777 --> 05:58.317
<b><i>Until two years ago, I was destined</i></b>

05:58.407 --> 06:00.487
<b><i>to be the leading figure of Suwa's future.</i></b>

06:01.157 --> 06:02.487
<b>It's the Hojo child!</b>

06:02.577 --> 06:06.247
<b>The young Hojo lord
has escaped and made his way to us!</b>

06:06.327 --> 06:08.537
<b>Oh, the poor Young Lord!</b>

06:08.617 --> 06:11.417
<b>Come, Lord Yoritsugu.
Let's go and welcome the Young Lord.</b>

06:12.917 --> 06:15.167
<b>I'm… fine.</b>

06:16.917 --> 06:18.877
<b>You made it!</b>

06:18.967 --> 06:22.257
<b>You've traveled a long way.
You must be tired.</b>

06:22.347 --> 06:25.677
<b>I've prepared a meal for you.
Come. This way.</b>

06:25.767 --> 06:27.977
<b>Young Lord! Quickly! This way!</b>

06:30.897 --> 06:32.477
<b>You're passing on your role as a god?</b>

06:32.557 --> 06:33.897
<b>That's right.</b>

06:33.977 --> 06:38.647
<b>I've already left most of
my duties as a god to my son, Tokitsugu.</b>

06:39.197 --> 06:43.077
<b>But I'd like to consolidate everything
under my grandson, Yoritsugu, instead.</b>

06:43.617 --> 06:46.537
<b><i>So that's what he meant when he said</i>
<i>they "made him a god."</i></b>

06:46.617 --> 06:48.787
<b><i>To think…</i>
<i>such a young child inheriting such a role…</i></b>

06:48.867 --> 06:50.997
<b>You left yourself wide open!</b>

06:51.077 --> 06:53.787
<b>That doesn't mean you should nuzzle me!</b>

06:53.877 --> 06:57.047
<b><i>He gets bigger and better nuzzles</i>
<i>than I ever got.</i></b>

06:58.717 --> 07:02.177
<b><i>And why do you get to sit next to</i>
<i>Grandpapa anyway?</i></b>

07:02.257 --> 07:04.637
<b><i>That should be my spot!</i></b>

07:05.887 --> 07:08.227
<b>Well then, Mr. Yorishige.
I think I'll be off for now.</b>

07:08.307 --> 07:10.977
<b>Don't be so quick to run away.
You'll make me sad.</b>

07:11.057 --> 07:12.897
<b>Just a little more?</b>

07:14.727 --> 07:17.067
<b>Please stop pawing all over me!</b>

07:18.187 --> 07:22.237
<b><i>He gets more aggressive pawing and tickles</i>
<i>than I ever got.</i></b>

07:22.317 --> 07:26.157
<b><i>Why do you get to hog Grandpapa's love?</i></b>

07:26.237 --> 07:29.367
<b><i>First, I must open</i>
<i>Grandpapa's eyes to reality.</i></b>

07:29.447 --> 07:30.457
<b>THUD</b>

07:31.417 --> 07:33.167
<b>Well, Lord Tokiyuki,</b>

07:33.247 --> 07:36.837
<b>I'd like us
to get to know each other more.</b>

07:36.917 --> 07:38.917
<b>Please make me your favorite!</b>

07:44.087 --> 07:46.637
<b>Lord Tokiyuki! What have you done?</b>

07:47.257 --> 07:49.597
<b>No, I… He just…</b>

07:50.427 --> 07:53.517
<b>He was the same when we met earlier.</b>

07:54.307 --> 07:58.357
<b>I don't think
Lord Tokiyuki likes me very much…</b>

07:59.277 --> 08:02.277
<b>When I went to introduce myself,
he grabbed me by the collar…</b>

08:02.357 --> 08:04.817
<b><i>I'm a Hojo.</i></b>

08:04.907 --> 08:08.157
<b><i>There is no one in Suwa above me.</i></b>

08:08.237 --> 08:12.867
<b><i>Face me in a showdown tomorrow.</i>
<i>The loser will be exiled.</i></b>

08:13.497 --> 08:17.417
<b>That's what he said to me. I didn't
want to, but I accepted his challenge.</b>

08:17.497 --> 08:22.257
<b>Lord Tokiyuki! I had no idea
you've been hiding such a menacing side!</b>

08:22.337 --> 08:25.387
<b>Lord Tokiyuki. Apologize. Apologize, now!</b>

08:25.467 --> 08:29.347
<b>Hey! In what world
would I ever say something like that?</b>

08:29.927 --> 08:31.267
<b>There's more.</b>

08:31.767 --> 08:34.727
<b><i>Someday, I'm going to kill that Yorishige.</i></b>

08:34.807 --> 08:37.357
<b><i>The way he shines so bright</i>
<i>is such an eyesore.</i></b>

08:37.977 --> 08:38.977
<b>He said.</b>

08:39.067 --> 08:43.107
<b>That is terrible.
Lord Tokiyuki. Apologize. To me.</b>

08:43.197 --> 08:46.777
<b>I would never say that!
And who was that supposed to be?</b>

08:47.367 --> 08:51.697
<b>But it's okay. Lord Tokiyuki is
the last shining light of the Hojo.</b>

08:51.787 --> 08:53.537
<b>If I must be exiled, there could be</b>

08:53.617 --> 08:55.707
<b>no greater honor
than to receive his judgment.</b>

08:56.287 --> 08:59.087
<b>And so, Lord Tokiyuki,
I will see you tomorrow for our showdown.</b>

09:00.087 --> 09:01.257
<b>Don't you dare run away.</b>

09:01.757 --> 09:05.427
<b>I will see to it that
you never set foot in these lands again.</b>

09:11.267 --> 09:15.097
<b>Good grief. You know it's not nice
to go around threatening children.</b>

09:15.187 --> 09:17.147
<b>Right, Lord Tokiyuki?</b>

09:17.227 --> 09:20.187
<b>Please.
I beg your forgiveness, Lord Tokiyuki.</b>

09:20.267 --> 09:22.777
<b>Yoritsugu must also be at fault here.</b>

09:22.857 --> 09:27.657
<b>After all, he can be rather ignorant
to the ways of the world.</b>

09:27.737 --> 09:31.287
<b>Yes. That's right. Y-Yes, exactly.
Let's just let this slide on both sides.</b>

09:32.487 --> 09:35.157
<b>You two. Sit down.</b>

09:38.207 --> 09:41.627
<b>You do know he was lying just now, right?</b>

09:42.417 --> 09:43.417
<b>Yes.</b>

09:44.127 --> 09:47.967
<b>And you do know that
my poor thigh took the brunt of it?</b>

09:49.047 --> 09:51.597
<b>We were feigning ignorance.</b>

09:54.177 --> 09:57.637
<b>As a freeloader,
I know that I'm encroaching on his space.</b>

09:58.267 --> 10:01.187
<b>In fact, I feel sorry for Yoritsugu.</b>

10:01.857 --> 10:02.937
<b>However,</b>

10:03.727 --> 10:05.567
<b>and I hope you can forgive my forwardness,</b>

10:06.447 --> 10:09.107
<b>but if his precious father and grandfather
continue to tolerate such behavior,</b>

10:09.657 --> 10:11.657
<b>don't you think he'll grow up
to become the sort of god</b>

10:11.737 --> 10:13.907
<b>who wouldn't hesitate
to bring people down?</b>

10:16.327 --> 10:20.627
<b>Please forgive our lack of manners.
We are truly ashamed.</b>

10:21.537 --> 10:24.457
<b>We feel… guilty
when it comes to the child.</b>

10:25.337 --> 10:26.337
<b>Guilty?</b>

10:27.167 --> 10:28.757
<b>For the sake
of his father and grandfather,</b>

10:29.427 --> 10:31.757
<b>he has been made to shoulder
such a heavy burden</b>

10:31.847 --> 10:33.177
<b>and at such a young age.</b>

10:34.177 --> 10:37.137
<b>Should the Arahitogami fall in battle,</b>

10:37.227 --> 10:39.687
<b>the entirety of Suwa Grand Shrine
would cease to exist.</b>

10:40.307 --> 10:43.107
<b>As my father and I are to join
the great war, we must entrust Yoritsugu,</b>

10:43.187 --> 10:47.777
<b>who has no involvement
in the fighting, with the role of god.</b>

10:48.987 --> 10:54.367
<b><i>I see. So that's why he had to become</i>
<i>a god at such a young age.</i></b>

10:55.447 --> 10:58.207
<b>But it is as you say, Lord Tokiyuki.</b>

10:58.827 --> 11:01.747
<b>As it stands, we are not setting him up
for a good future.</b>

11:02.327 --> 11:05.747
<b>In fact, he may
be taking his destiny too seriously.</b>

11:06.587 --> 11:08.467
<b>He acts sweet for us,</b>

11:08.547 --> 11:11.047
<b>but he no longer lets on
to anyone how he truly feels about things.</b>

11:11.677 --> 11:16.267
<b>And now, he is showing his true feelings,
his hatred, to you, and you alone.</b>

11:17.017 --> 11:18.927
<b>This could be the perfect opportunity.</b>

11:19.427 --> 11:23.107
<b>Please go out there
and handle this showdown well.</b>

11:23.187 --> 11:27.107
<b>Please become the kind of friend
he feels he can open up to.</b>

11:27.187 --> 11:29.027
<b>You irresponsible parents!</b>

11:30.857 --> 11:36.537
<b><i>That said, I still am partly to blame.</i>
<i>I'll do my best to get along with him.</i></b>

11:37.657 --> 11:38.997
<b><i>We may be calling it a showdown.</i></b>

11:39.077 --> 11:41.157
<b><i>But really,</i>
<i>we're just two kids playing games.</i></b>

11:41.247 --> 11:43.457
<b><i>That should give us the opportunity</i>
<i>to open up to one another.</i></b>

11:43.537 --> 11:44.957
<b>THE NEXT DAY</b>

11:45.037 --> 11:46.207
<b>GOOD LUCK, LORD YORITSUGU</b>

11:46.297 --> 11:48.047
<b>He's really out for a fight!</b>

11:48.127 --> 11:50.917
<b>I told you. I am a god.</b>

11:51.007 --> 11:54.677
<b>One word from me, and the entirety
of Suwa Grand Shrine will bend to my will.</b>

11:56.097 --> 11:58.807
<b>I'm impressed
you decided to show up, Tokiyuki.</b>

11:59.307 --> 12:03.017
<b>Our showdown will be a game of tag.
And you're "It."</b>

12:04.057 --> 12:07.187
<b>My goal will be the Holy Pillar.</b>

12:07.267 --> 12:11.607
<b>If you can't catch me
before I get to it, I win.</b>

12:12.107 --> 12:14.867
<b>You will pack your things and leave.</b>

12:15.657 --> 12:20.077
<b>Yoritsugu.
I just want to get along with you.</b>

12:20.577 --> 12:22.997
<b>And if we're going to play a game of tag,</b>

12:23.077 --> 12:26.207
<b>I must say,
I'm going to be faster than you…</b>

12:26.287 --> 12:28.587
<b>I don't want to hear it!
The game starts now!</b>

12:28.667 --> 12:29.667
<b>What?</b>

12:29.757 --> 12:31.877
<b>Ugh… Fine.</b>

12:35.337 --> 12:36.547
<b>What?</b>

12:36.637 --> 12:38.557
<b>Mr. Moritaka?</b>

12:38.637 --> 12:40.967
<b>I'm not sure I understand
the circumstances, Lord Tokiyuki,</b>

12:41.057 --> 12:42.517
<b>but do forgive me.</b>

12:43.017 --> 12:47.477
<b>Lord Yoritsugu says if I don't stop you,
there will be divine punishment.</b>

12:49.607 --> 12:51.987
<b>This is the power of an Arahitogami.</b>

12:52.067 --> 12:55.607
<b>They all do exactly as I say.</b>

12:55.697 --> 12:59.987
<b>A human is no match for a god, Tokiyuki!</b>

13:00.947 --> 13:02.327
<b>Well then, dear god.</b>

13:03.207 --> 13:06.457
<b>I might need to teach you a little lesson.</b>

13:28.807 --> 13:31.187
<b>Young Lord! Prepare yourself!</b>

13:41.537 --> 13:42.787
<b>Huh?</b>

13:45.037 --> 13:47.827
<b>He's escaped that way! Stop him!</b>

13:58.927 --> 14:01.097
<b><i>Compared to the hundred</i>
<i>I went up against before,</i></b>

14:01.927 --> 14:03.637
<b><i>this is no problem at all.</i></b>

14:04.597 --> 14:09.017
<b><i>If you want to stop me,</i>
<i>you'd better bring arrows or Sadamune!</i></b>

14:12.687 --> 14:14.187
<b><i>There really is no stopping him.</i></b>

14:15.817 --> 14:17.487
<b><i>You wouldn't guess it by looking at him,</i></b>

14:17.567 --> 14:20.487
<b><i>but he's survived many battles,</i>
<i>though never officially.</i></b>

14:21.737 --> 14:23.327
<b><i>Meanwhile,</i></b>

14:23.407 --> 14:25.617
<b>-<i>Lord Yoritsugu has only just become god.</i>
-What?</b>

14:25.697 --> 14:28.827
<b><i>Those doing his bidding are mostly</i>
<i>civilians who have never seen combat.</i></b>

14:28.917 --> 14:30.247
<b><i>There's no way they can stop him.</i></b>

14:32.537 --> 14:36.337
<b>No way! How did you do that so easily?</b>

14:36.417 --> 14:39.467
<b><i>How did he get past all of us?</i></b>

14:42.177 --> 14:45.057
<b>All right.
It's just you and me now, Yoritsugu.</b>

14:45.717 --> 14:49.767
<b><i>Huh? Oh, my gosh, oh, my gosh,</i>
<i>oh, my gosh! Why is he so excited?</i></b>

14:55.227 --> 15:00.407
<b><i>But I've been walking the grounds of Suwa</i>
<i>Grand Shrine from the moment I was born.</i></b>

15:01.067 --> 15:03.197
<b><i>You've only been living here</i>
<i>for less than two years.</i></b>

15:04.027 --> 15:05.987
<b><i>I am far more familiar</i>
<i>with the terrain than you!</i></b>

15:10.287 --> 15:13.707
<b>Now, he'll have to take a big detour.</b>

15:14.207 --> 15:19.377
<b>I will reach the Holy Pillar
before he does.</b>

15:30.227 --> 15:32.647
<b>The Holy Pillar is still a long way off.</b>

15:33.807 --> 15:36.687
<b>Would you like to keep going, Yoritsugu?</b>

15:37.477 --> 15:39.567
<b>What is with you?</b>

15:39.647 --> 15:42.907
<b>I thought
you were only good at running away.</b>

15:42.987 --> 15:45.617
<b>Since when were you good at chasing too?</b>

15:46.947 --> 15:50.117
<b>I guess I just get a burst of energy
when I'm chasing while being chased.</b>

15:50.997 --> 15:55.287
<b>And I know that nobody needs
to get hurt in this situation.</b>

15:55.377 --> 15:57.627
<b>So I can just let loose
and have fun with it.</b>

15:59.507 --> 16:04.087
<b>But going forward,
I must become a symbol of war,</b>

16:04.177 --> 16:06.507
<b>knowing that it means hurting people.</b>

16:09.057 --> 16:12.727
<b>If I am exiled, you may have to step up
to that role instead.</b>

16:13.557 --> 16:17.267
<b>You and I are both destined
to become symbols at a very young age.</b>

16:17.357 --> 16:22.027
<b>But I think you can wait a little longer
before you start hurting people.</b>

16:26.067 --> 16:28.077
<b>You think you're so high and mighty!</b>

16:28.157 --> 16:30.247
<b>This showdown's not over ye--</b>

16:48.217 --> 16:49.347
<b>Yoritsugu!</b>

16:49.927 --> 16:53.937
<b><i>I need to find something for him to grab.</i>
<i>I need to be quick, or it'll be too late!</i></b>

16:56.187 --> 16:57.607
<b>-Grab on!
-Huh?</b>

17:05.817 --> 17:08.487
<b>Owie owie owie!</b>

17:08.577 --> 17:11.697
<b>You idiot! You're gonna rip your hair!</b>

17:11.787 --> 17:14.917
<b>It's fine! Just hurry up and climb!</b>

17:15.577 --> 17:18.497
<b>If your hair rips,
you won't be seen as pure!</b>

17:18.587 --> 17:21.877
<b>You'll lose your prestige
among the people!</b>

17:21.957 --> 17:25.377
<b>You're growing yours out
for the same reason as me!</b>

17:26.337 --> 17:30.387
<b>The only symbol of purity we need is you!</b>

17:30.467 --> 17:33.807
<b>You are a Suwa, and I am a Hojo.</b>

17:33.887 --> 17:40.067
<b>After all, my destiny lies
on the battlefield and nowhere else.</b>

17:40.147 --> 17:43.397
<b>Please hurry! My neck's about to snap!</b>

18:00.457 --> 18:01.707
<b>You're an idiot.</b>

18:02.417 --> 18:05.377
<b>If you'd let me die, you would have had
one less burden to deal with.</b>

18:06.677 --> 18:08.837
<b>I wanted to be your friend.</b>

18:09.467 --> 18:12.217
<b>But more than anything,
I don't want to make Mr. Yorishige sad.</b>

18:16.477 --> 18:20.897
<b>Mr. Yorishige is like a father to me,</b>

18:21.897 --> 18:25.647
<b>but it's no match
for the familial bond that you two share.</b>

18:29.697 --> 18:31.067
<b>Ever since you arrived,</b>

18:32.117 --> 18:34.197
<b>Grandpapa's been having
more and more meetings</b>

18:34.287 --> 18:36.997
<b>with Shinano warriors that
I've never met before.</b>

18:37.077 --> 18:40.457
<b>He doesn't visit me as much as he used to.</b>

18:44.457 --> 18:47.927
<b>I don't even care about being a god.</b>

18:48.007 --> 18:52.967
<b>I just don't want anyone
stealing my grandpapa away from me.</b>

18:55.177 --> 18:59.597
<b><i>I see. Mr. Yorishige's been too busy</i>
<i>for Yoritsugu ever since the war started.</i></b>

19:02.187 --> 19:06.027
<b>All right then.
Leave it with me, Yoritsugu.</b>

19:06.107 --> 19:07.107
<b>Huh?</b>

19:07.687 --> 19:12.197
<b>I am your father and
your grandfather's lord, after all.</b>

19:12.277 --> 19:14.407
<b>I can ask them to indulge me
once in a while.</b>

19:16.907 --> 19:18.907
<b>Which is why, Mr. Yorishige,</b>

19:18.997 --> 19:20.827
<b>I have ordered Mr. Tokitsugu</b>

19:20.917 --> 19:25.627
<b>to handle all duties as head of Suwa
on his own for the next three days.</b>

19:27.167 --> 19:29.047
<b>And I command you, Mr. Yorishige,</b>

19:29.127 --> 19:31.677
<b>to dote on your grandson
for the next three days.</b>

19:32.297 --> 19:34.677
<b>Please don't let him feel lonely anymore.</b>

19:37.517 --> 19:40.727
<b>Now, Mr. Yorishige is all yours
for the next three days.</b>

19:41.347 --> 19:43.437
<b>Make him dote on you as much as you like.</b>

19:44.857 --> 19:46.187
<b>Tokiyuki?</b>

19:48.397 --> 19:51.407
<b>I see.
So you've been feeling lonely, Yoritsugu.</b>

19:51.907 --> 19:54.947
<b>And you're right. I haven't been paying
much attention to you lately.</b>

19:55.027 --> 19:56.027
<b>RUB RUB RUB RUB RUB RUB RUB</b>

19:56.117 --> 19:57.697
<b>Why didn't you say so sooner?</b>

19:57.787 --> 20:01.367
<b>I'm gonna love you
with all my heart, body, and soul.</b>

20:01.457 --> 20:03.667
<b>Rub rub rub rub rub…</b>

20:04.167 --> 20:06.997
<b>Rub rub rub rub rub…</b>

20:10.467 --> 20:14.677
<b><i>That hurts. His aged cheek is hurting me.</i></b>

20:15.427 --> 20:20.807
<b><i>Yorishige's aging skin is as rough</i>
<i>as 1,500 grit sandpaper.</i></b>

20:21.307 --> 20:23.687
<b><i>While a few minutes of nuzzling</i>
<i>would normally be harmless,</i></b>

20:23.767 --> 20:26.687
<b><i>three days and three nights of continuous</i>
<i>nuzzling would cause skin to split,</i></b>

20:26.767 --> 20:29.147
<b><i>flesh to tear, and bone to sand.</i></b>

20:29.647 --> 20:32.397
<b><i>Yorishige himself has something akin</i>
<i>to divine protection.</i></b>

20:32.487 --> 20:34.027
<b><i>He suffers zero damage.</i></b>

20:34.617 --> 20:38.237
<b><i>And hey, just because I don't want</i>
<i>anyone stealing my grandpapa away from me</i></b>

20:38.327 --> 20:41.077
<b><i>doesn't mean I'm a fan of nuzzling.</i></b>

20:41.577 --> 20:45.417
<b><i>In fact, I even get sick of him</i>
<i>when it's just the two of us all the time.</i></b>

20:46.997 --> 20:49.877
<b><i>Wait… Is this all he's gonna do</i>
<i>for the next three days?</i></b>

20:50.917 --> 20:53.127
<b>I must do as Lord Tokiyuki commands.</b>

20:53.217 --> 20:56.297
<b>Get ready for a million cheek rubs
over the next three days!</b>

20:56.387 --> 20:57.387
<b>No!</b>

20:57.467 --> 20:59.307
<b>SCREEEEEEECH</b>

21:05.397 --> 21:08.567
<b>Hey, Young Lord. What's up?
You seem to be in a good mood.</b>

21:08.647 --> 21:10.147
<b>ZERO MALICE</b>

21:10.227 --> 21:15.197
<b>Kojiro. It feels good
knowing you've done a good deed.</b>

21:15.277 --> 21:16.407
<b>Huh?</b>

21:18.657 --> 21:19.657
<b>THE END</b>

21:19.737 --> 21:22.407
<b>I'll get you for this, Tokiyuki.</b>

21:23.077 --> 21:26.537
<b><i>Yoritsugu Suwa was seven at this time.</i></b>

21:27.287 --> 21:30.377
<b><i>He went on to become</i>
<i>one of Tokiyuki's greatest comrades.</i></b>

21:42.927 --> 21:45.267
<b>What's with that samurai?</b>

21:45.847 --> 21:48.397
<b>Yeah. He looks really motivated.</b>

21:51.567 --> 21:56.987
<b>It's almost like he's got the words
"let's do this" written on his face.</b>

21:58.527 --> 22:01.197
<b>Now, I wonder
if Lord Tokiyuki is doing well?</b>

22:01.287 --> 22:02.287
<b>LET'S DO THIS</b>

22:02.367 --> 22:04.867
<b>TOKIYUKI'S UNCLE
YASUIE HOJO</b>

23:38.047 --> 23:38.877
<b><i>Let's go!</i></b>

23:38.967 --> 23:39.837
<b>EPISODE 15 (1335) - TOKIYUKI
AND THE THREE GREAT GENERALS</b>
